@startuml
title Sequence Diagram UC09 - Skenario Alternatif 1: Penonaktifan Akun Kurator

skinparam shadowing false
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true

actor Administrator as Aktor
boundary ":HalamanPengelolaanAkun" as V
control ":KontrolPengelolaanAkun" as C
entity ":Kurator" as Ku
control ":KontrolAutentikasi" as CA

Aktor -> V ++ : klikNonaktifkan(idAkun)
V -> C ++ : nonaktifkanKurator(idAkun)
C -> Ku ++ : nonaktifkan()
return statusAktif = false
C -> CA ++ : putusSesi(idAkun)
return sesi terputus
note right of C
  Sesi Kurator diputus seketika bila sedang login.
  Pencegahan login berikutnya ditangani cekAktif()
  pada skenario normal UC05 (KF37).
end note
return berhasil
return tabelDaftarKurator diperbarui, akun nonaktif
@enduml
